@startuml
skin rose
skinparam ActivityFontSize 15
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
start
:A contact is renamed or deleted;
:Build updated copies of the events
that list the contact;

'Since the beta syntax does not support placing the condition outside the
'diamond we place it as the true branch instead.

if () then ([renamed, and an event already
lists the new name])
    :Reject the rename;
    :Leave the contact and
    events unchanged;
    stop
else ([else])
endif
:Replace or remove the contact;
:Replace the events with
the updated copies;
stop
@enduml
